HAProxy 3.3 patch series
========================

Apply this series in order to a HAProxy 3.3 source tree before the OTel filter
can be built into it.  The shared notes in ../README describe the patches and
the way to apply them; the commands for this branch are:

  % cd haproxy-3.3.*
  % cat /path/to/patches/3.3/*.patch | patch -p1

From a git checkout:

  % git am /path/to/patches/3.3/*.patch

Both files are needed.  The first adds the EXTRA_MAKE variable to the top-level
Makefile, the second adds the ARGC_OTEL value the addon uses.
